# 统一换行符：仓库内文本一律 LF。
# 没有这份文件时 Windows 检出会按 core.autocrlf 转成 CRLF，
# 导致 CI 里 gofmt -l 误报所有 .go 文件。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.dex binary
*.aar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
